26; Laboratory Medicine, University of Calgary home page</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ucalgary.ca/UofC/faculties/medicine/PATH/Banff_Path_Course/ImagesDocuments/Thurs%200715%20Rosai%20A%20Class%20Scheme.pdf"/></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brodatz</surname><given-names>Ph</given-names></name></person-group><source>Textures for artists and designers</source><year>1966</year><publisher-name>Dover Publication Inc. N.Y.</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>